      "role": "user",
      "content": "im just sitting here thinking about how much of a drain i am on everyone. i look at my sister and she looks so exhausted just trying to help me with basic stuff. i feel like i'm just taking up space and making their lives harder every single day. it's just embarrassing at this point.",
